# Vercel builds only the Astro frontend (Root Directory = frontend/) plus the API functions that
# tools/build_api_functions.py generates under frontend/ at deploy time. Keep uploads lean by
# excluding the repository's own backend, database and other non-frontend assets.
#
# Every directory pattern is anchored with a leading "/": an unanchored `db/` or `webapp/` would
# also match frontend/_sggs/db/ and frontend/_sggs/webapp/ and silently drop the API's databases
# and code from the upload (webapp/tests/test_api_functions.py guards this).
/db/
/database.sqlite
/webapp/
/ios/
/pipeline/
/corpus/
/concordance/
/validation/
/audit/
/contract/
*.pdf
*.key
